sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 2PC Coordinator
    participant O as order-db
    participant P as payment-db
    participant I as inventory-db

    C->>O: BEGIN#59; create + confirm order
    C->>O: PREPARE TRANSACTION
    O-->>C: prepared
    C->>P: BEGIN#59; charge payment
    C->>P: PREPARE TRANSACTION
    P-->>C: prepared
    C->>I: BEGIN#59; reserve stock
    C->>I: PREPARE TRANSACTION
    I-->>C: prepared
    C->>O: COMMIT PREPARED
    C->>P: COMMIT PREPARED
    C->>I: COMMIT PREPARED
